'''Ice Prison''' is a monster modifier. Monsters with this mod will occasionally cast a {{il|Frost Wall}} Nova to trap players. However unlike bosses that use similar circular wall skills, such as [[Winterfang]] and [[Burtok, Conjurer of Bones]], the Frost Wall from the Ice Prison will have an opening instead of completely surrounding the target, similar to [[Sirus]]' Maze skill. The opening may still be blocked by terrain. 

Players and monsters can not pass through Ice Prison. There are some exceptions: teleporting and leaping skills, and [[phasing]] allow traversing past them.

