==Legacy variant==
The legacy [[archnemesis]] version (prefix form {{ml|MonsterArchnemesisGlacialCage}}) also grants the monster the following (as of 3.19.1c patch):

: {{c|mod|50% of Physical Damage Converted to Cold Damage}}
:{{c|mod|Gain 25% of Physical Damage as Extra Cold Damage}}
:{{c|mod|30% increased Cold Damage}}
:{{c|mod|+40% to Cold Resistance}}
:{{c|mod|50% reduced effect of Cold Ailments}}
:{{c|mod|20% additional Physical Damage Reduction}}

